From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikita Sokolsky <sokolx@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:45:25 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] dynarmic arm64: one A64 code cache shared by a process's
 cores

Port of Lichii PR #2101 (x64) to the arm64 backend, with the fault-handling change, lock-free lookups and the two
review fixes (clear-wait honours pause and quit; invalidations de-duplicated). Switched on with
EDEN_NX2_SHARED_JIT_CACHE=<MiB>, a multiple of 128.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
